%% Conceptual workflow based on the documented human-directed engineering process.
%% AI output is not itself verification; human review and acceptance remain explicit.
flowchart TD
    A[Human defines problem, constraints, and acceptance criteria]
    --> B[Plan approach and identify relevant context]
    B --> C[Provide focused context to AI collaborator]
    C --> D[Implement in small, reviewable steps]
    D --> E[Run deterministic tests and checks]
    E --> F{Does the evidence support the result?}
    F -- No --> G[Diagnose, revise, and retest]
    G --> D
    F -- Yes --> H[Human review and acceptance decision]
    H --> I[Document decisions, trade-offs, and follow-up work]
